openmediavault-1panel (8.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: 1Panel server management panel plugin for
    OpenMediaVault 8.x.
    - Installs the official upstream binaries (v2 series) from the
      1Panel CDN with sha256 verification, non-interactively using
      the official installer (Docker installation and daemon.json
      changes are explicitly disabled).
    - Start/stop/restart, online upgrade through the official
      '1pctl update' and non-interactive uninstall that keeps the
      panel data directory.
    - Live status of the 1panel-core and 1panel-agent services,
      installed/latest version detection, log viewer and account
      synchronization via the official CLI.
    - Simplified and Traditional Chinese translations included.

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Sat, 04 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
